.*
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Produced by the recorded `setup` command (`pip install -e .`).
# `.venv/` is already covered by the leading `.*` rule.
*.egg-info/

# AI Development Standard
!.ai/
!.ai/**
!.kiro/
!.kiro/**

# Rust build artifacts (desktop/src-tauri). Cargo.lock is intentionally
# tracked, matching convention for a binary crate. gen/ is regenerated by
# tauri-build on every `cargo build` (ACL/capability schema files).
desktop/src-tauri/target/
desktop/src-tauri/gen/
